# Sample data packages are fetched or generated (see scripts/gen-cube-sample-data.mjs).
# Reformatting them makes regenerated output diff against the committed form for
# no reason — same rationale as packages/chat/.prettierignore's `public/data`.
sample-data/

# pnpm writes this file in its own style; prettier rewrites it to a different
# one, so the pre-commit hook and the next `pnpm install` fight over it and
# every dependency bump carries thousands of lines of pure formatting churn.
# Let pnpm own its lockfile. (packages/chat/.prettierignore already says this,
# but the lockfile lives at the root, where that file never applies.)
pnpm-lock.yaml

node_modules
dist
